      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "The learned counsel for the petitioner fairly submits that after the listing of the contempt petition,\nthe order of this Court, dated 15.04.2025 has been complied with by the respondents.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 932,
