      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.13453124463558197
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "The learned counsel for the petitioner would however submit that there is a delay of 8 days and hence, the Court should admonish the respondent for the delay and impose cost.",
